# PART 1 — PROJECT IDENTITY & VISION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

## 1.1 Platform Name
GE_Sky — Global E-Commerce Sky

## 1.2 One-Line Definition
GE_Sky is a unified, AI-powered, multi-agent digital business operating system that combines e-commerce, digital marketing, CRM, analytics, automation, and AI-driven decision support into a single intelligent platform — replacing the fragmented stack of 5-8 separate tools with one cohesive system.

## 1.3 Core Philosophy
- "One platform instead of many tools"
- "Intelligent automation instead of manual work"
- "Unified data and vision instead of fragmented chaos"
- "Smart operations instead of operational chaos"

## 1.4 Target Users
- E-commerce store owners (small to medium)
- SMEs with digital presence
- Digital marketing agencies managing multiple clients
- Emerging D2C brands
- Multi-channel commerce teams
- Enterprise clients (with white-label needs)

## 1.5 Business Model
- SaaS subscription (monthly/yearly)
- Three tiers: Basic, Advanced, Enterprise
- 14-day free trial (no credit card required)
- Setup/customization services (one-time fees)
- Value-added services (integrations, custom automation, advanced reports)
- White-label for Enterprise tier
- Future: performance-based fees, marketplace fees

## 1.6 Markets
- Phase 1: Algeria (local launch)
- Phase 2: North Africa (Tunisia, Morocco, Egypt) + Middle East (Saudi Arabia, UAE)
- Phase 3: International expansion (emerging markets globally)

