10.2 Quality Standards
Every form must have client-side AND server-side validation
Every table must have: search, filters, sorting, pagination, bulk actions, export
Every list must have: empty state, loading state, error state, no-results state
Every modal must have: backdrop, close button, escape key, focus trap, restore focus
Every notification must have: title, message, action (optional), dismiss
Every page must have: breadcrumb, title, responsive layout, proper meta tags
Every API endpoint must have: auth guard, tenant context, rate limiting, input validation, error handling, audit logging
Every database table must have: id (UUID), tenant_id, created_at, updated_at, appropriate indexes
Every component must be: accessible, responsive, themed, internationalized, typed
